        "verbatim": "Hello! I've verified your identity for property at 606 Listing St, Market Town (Customer ID: HG-2211). \n\n**Regarding your questions:**\n\n1. **Refund Policy**: Yes, diagnostic inspections are **non-refundable** according to our policy. This applies to all diagnostic inspections regardless of findings.\n\n2. **Documentation for Real Estate Transactions**: Our inspection reports include:\n   - Comprehensive property assessment with detailed findings\n   - Pre-inspection photo documentation of all accessible areas\n   - EPA pesticide codes (if any treatments were previously applied)\n   - Technician signature and certification\n   - Clear documentation of any active infestations or damage\n   - Recommendations for any necessary treatments\n\nThese reports are designed to meet standard real estate transaction requirements.\n\n3. **Report Turnaround Time**: Typical inspection reports are delivered within **24-48 hours** after the inspection completion. For urgent real estate transactions, we can prioritize reports with same-day turnaround upon request.\n\n**Available Inspection Slots:**\nI found several available time slots for your diagnostic termite inspection:\n- January 29, 2025: 10:00 AM - 12:00 PM\n- January 30, 2025: 2:00 PM - 4:00 PM  \n- February 1, 2025: 9:00 AM - 11:00 AM\n- February 4, 2025: 3:00 PM - 5:00 PM\n\nWould you like to schedule one of these time slots? Please note that termite inspections fall under the \"wood destroyers\" pest category.",
